{"version":1,"key":"article:61","content":{"id":61,"title":"安全算法","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"628794d0-a238-4693-aded-5fe0d7619a86","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们在使用互联网交换数据时，数据需要经过各种各样的网络设备才能到达通信双方，如果数据在传输的过程中经过某些恶意用户的设备，就有可能导致信息被窃取。所以如果想安全的使用互联网，了解必须的安全技术是不可或缺的。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"95210128-23df-4ec0-89cf-3a10380fe023","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"安全问题"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"14f76833-8ff9-4819-9524-4ce1a3ce76e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们首先了解一下在通信的过程中会遇到什么样的安全问题。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"84fdc7d8-31fc-4cd3-83cc-11d3de6b29a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"窃听"}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<video style=\"max-width: 100%;\" controls src=\"https://video-obsidian.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Safe01.mp4\"></video>","collabId":"fc6b22ac-2765-4134-8a90-36b6406e818d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7b7ac187-e511-457c-b992-358c18dd329a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"A 向 B 发送的信息可能会在传输的过程中被 X 偷看，这就是窃听。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"3551d057-89d7-405e-a6d0-3ba48cb4c626","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假冒"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9d51af07-0a0a-4fca-afbe-7c771332e267.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9d51af07-0a0a-4fca-afbe-7c771332e267.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"f798a758-8a1b-4ea1-a309-8c1dc754656f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"be8ffee8-bb19-41b4-b752-805b47afc534","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"A 以为给 B 发送了消息，但是 B 有可能是 X 冒充的；同样 B 以为收到了 A 的消息，但是 A 也有可能是 X 冒充的，这种问题叫做假冒。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"d2612c97-a10d-41f7-b1a0-6aa5e8164f40","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"篡改"}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<video style=\"max-width: 100%;\" controls src=\"https://video-obsidian.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Safe02.mp4\"></video>","collabId":"3d13a180-d68d-436f-adcc-ab55420b9fbf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f0435d40-7bc4-48f5-b54c-1bb75abf2a90","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 确实收到了 A 发送的信息，但是内容已经被 X 给改变了，这种行为叫做篡改。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"7cf8c631-25f4-41d8-a766-5ff15932b997","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"事后否认"}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<video style=\"max-width: 100%;\" controls src=\"https://video-obsidian.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Safe03.mp4\"></video>","collabId":"447836c2-1a05-46fb-a247-8655b81ebb68","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"df7b3c1e-c11f-4839-aca8-3875d72209b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 从 A 那里收到了消息，但是 A 在事后宣称消息不是它发的，这会导致互联网上的商业交易或合同无法成立，这种行为叫做事后否认。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ad9fe229-bdfb-4efd-8e68-1e420169cf2e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在这篇文章中就着重解决这四类问题，对于窃听，我们对消息进行加密技术；对于假冒，我们使用消息认证码或数字签名；对于篡改，我们同样可以使用消息认证码或数字签名；对于事后否认，我们可以使用数字签名。"}]},{"type":"table","tauContract":"6b49184b8918108ccf1636963138d105f679894dfe0d7b7abd75a6e6db67056b","collabId":"0c7354c9-58f3-4551-9821-99a49acf6597","children":[{"type":"table-row","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","collabId":"3c090987-fbc7-4ad8-b012-254a897c4f89","children":[{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"e13da4d8-fbc3-4c52-a723-0ffae677cb85","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"问题"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"003b494f-1ec9-4248-a0a9-5dd1e4159cf3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解决办法"}]}]},{"type":"table-row","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","collabId":"66c8482d-f01c-4fae-9779-2e0b3ad19a89","children":[{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"b5c8b3e9-3402-40f7-b63d-ca29466b61ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"窃听"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"5a46e8fb-8647-4c30-bea0-1ec65a37319d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"加密"}]}]},{"type":"table-row","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","collabId":"569eb91b-d72b-4e97-9873-04b3f5fd1941","children":[{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"b9ba23fa-ab61-411a-8881-129fff2f7e3d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假冒"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"85902c27-5fda-4ecb-a49b-109fff142fd7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"消息认证码或数字签名"}]}]},{"type":"table-row","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","collabId":"e434564d-1150-4fd7-9875-e35e8bbe94e5","children":[{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"92cebb07-55d8-4b3e-b0ff-ac908d98459c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"篡改"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"580a0c44-447a-4500-89f8-bb39474bf3f2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"消息认证码或数字签名"}]}]},{"type":"table-row","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","collabId":"b4f0830e-6ef1-4adf-afca-dd567b99242d","children":[{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"6f9caf72-d3f7-40d3-9d90-eb5574fd5700","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"事后否认"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"e16dd140-f997-4b54-8b7c-739c16c6d507","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数字签名"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d529005f-cbc2-4122-8160-6bb95e07cebc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数字签名存在无法确认公开密钥制作者的问题，我们可以使用数字证书来解决，具体的过程我们在后面分析。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"a721a71d-156d-47d9-b9c0-b059993256d2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对称加密"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4c57231d-39e5-42d3-995d-cb3c54917983","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果我们在互联网上直接将消息发送过去的话，有可能会被窃听，所以我们需要将消息变为密文，然后发送出去，将消息变为密文的过程叫做加密，同样在接收方需要将密文变为明文(消息)，这个过程叫做解密。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5368c806-6beb-4b92-bcca-cf2c135ac498","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在加密和解密的过程中需要用到密钥，所谓的密钥可以类比于钥匙，钥匙的作用就是加锁与开锁，而密钥的作用是加密与解密。根据加密和解密是否使用的是相同的密钥，可以分为对称加密与非对称加密："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"3b215111-3424-48af-a184-240c83faecff","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ce6de068-d948-4556-8ddb-5d13ca571bcb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"02e2878b-04bd-4583-bc72-d760afd4dcfa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对称加密：加密和解密的密钥是同一个密钥"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d46bfad5-e3c0-4976-8d03-9d1ac8733e45","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5dea0df4-5145-4ce1-b89e-3411a64e7712","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"非对称加密：加密和解密的密钥不相同"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"297192d8-9876-4c32-a5c7-9de175f97640","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在本小节中就介绍对称加密，以及对称加密存在什么问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2a1d9c4f-d5db-4321-885a-3be62b4fcd3d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对称加密的过如下："}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20201031092108.utibeyvdfgg_a0ecf363-f5b8-4c37-ac56-7f5edd15dd3c.gif","previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20201031092108.utibeyvdfgg_a0ecf363-f5b8-4c37-ac56-7f5edd15dd3c.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"04c8a90d-091d-45d3-86a3-4faea9f1ad23","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"81140b07-4e80-405f-a8b4-a7a37701d36c","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"302baed8-0a58-434b-b8d0-842e1d90a29d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5a3c969d-d329-4a03-8c9f-e7a3588be354","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"A 将密钥 key 发送给 B"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1f167f69-0d0e-4105-a181-5cdadb833901","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a768a181-f336-45bc-b7cc-2966fae305bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"A 使用密钥 key 对消息 aaa 加密，得到密文 xyz"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a88a7641-9748-408e-a3f0-85f50abfd669","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9d659b4a-89ff-4f90-a14b-083b855c20df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 接到密文 xyz，使用密钥 key 对密文解密得到 aaa"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"84a016ec-2b0d-4a73-bc9b-d68df01a3931","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这时如果窃听者来窃听的话，因为窃听者没有密钥，所以无法得知明文是什么。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9ed28f46-ddc4-4079-ae20-670e05640500","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是上述的加密有一个问题，如果密钥 key 在 A 发送给 B 的时候被窃听了"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6b6f8cdc-cf7b-4e83-8908-a815d880978d.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6b6f8cdc-cf7b-4e83-8908-a815d880978d.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"1147a0d8-2e88-4ced-b806-10aba5b356b3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6ddca3bc-af13-4ea9-a0ea-f67c7b464fe7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这时窃听者就知道密钥，以此将密文解密，从而窃听消息。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"4b5e492d-76c7-4622-8fa1-4ba16e2c80db","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"非对称加密"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"36d2a655-d313-454f-abd1-6e41535c12f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"非对称加密指的是加密的密钥和解密的密钥不是同一个密钥，我们把加密密钥称为公开密钥，因为它是可以公开的，任何人都可以访问到，我们称解密密钥为私有密钥。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"18fded0f-0a18-41c7-bc60-6d11ee858254","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当 A 给 B 发送消息时，在此之前，B 会生成公开密钥和私有密钥，然后 B 将公开密钥发送给 A，接着 A 使用该公开密钥加密消息，并将消息发送给 B，当 B 接收到消息之后，使用私有密钥对消息解密"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20201030185737762022-10-23-19-40-08_3a07f4cd-f224-436c-9506-2a225fec9e72.gif","previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20201030185737762022-10-23-19-40-08_3a07f4cd-f224-436c-9506-2a225fec9e72.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"86721435-9cde-4286-9117-5b71f0df9b46","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7612cf8f-d82d-40e0-ad21-db9bed240121","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"即使窃听者窃听到了密文以及公开密钥，但是它没有私有密钥，所以它不能解密出消息。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"11dab297-6f4e-4dea-88b5-4c1c854325ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是这种方法并不是完美的，假设在 B 向 A 发送公开密钥时，窃听者将 B 公开密钥修改为了自己的公开密钥发送给 A"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202010310922452022-10-23-19-41-36_d498bb2b-b75e-44bb-88fc-d924aff45500.gif","previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202010310922452022-10-23-19-41-36_d498bb2b-b75e-44bb-88fc-d924aff45500.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"2eedbc5a-700d-4c20-a234-fd19f3d6b416","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"439eb312-1c0f-4249-acdd-cd27f4792936","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为公开密钥并不能指明来源是谁，当 A 接收到密钥时误以为是 B 的公开密钥，这样当 A 向 B 发送消息时，其实使用的是窃听者的公开密钥来加密消息，这时窃听者通过私钥解密，从而窃听到消息"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202010310923102022-10-23-19-42-37_e7f71945-5212-4ce9-8a2e-67216d548c20.gif","previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202010310923102022-10-23-19-42-37_e7f71945-5212-4ce9-8a2e-67216d548c20.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"82b922ed-a54d-444d-b5c1-c028a834b185","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"41b1cbb3-0f46-4792-94b1-506ea7411d54","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"并且再次使用 B 的公开密钥加密消息，将消息发送给 B，对于 A 和 B 来说，它们完全没有意识到自己被窃听了"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202010310923262022-10-23-19-43-38_32722b01-4502-4e35-8916-f6cd8c8a476d.gif","previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202010310923262022-10-23-19-43-38_32722b01-4502-4e35-8916-f6cd8c8a476d.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"0988be46-3f23-4409-adfe-7ece9b0dd41f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"15554c27-6ad1-4bfe-b11c-f750f8b86fd5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这种通过中途替换公开密钥来窃听数据的攻击方法叫做"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"中间人攻击"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"321089b4-7c6d-498a-81b7-4107cf428ae6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4a761504-9b8a-4c9b-bb0e-92de87d87527","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"非对称加密可靠性会出现问题就是因为 A 无法判断接收到的密钥是否来自于 B，想要解决这个问题，就要用到后面讲到的数字证书。"}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"6a199cc3-6638-4fe6-bf2a-c0a5fcfca9b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"混合加密"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1c1e7dd7-29f6-478d-b29d-4df93f85d825","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用非对称加密虽然比对称加密安全，但是非对称加密方法加密和解密所需的资源以及时间比对称加密方法所需的资源和时间代价高很多，那么就有人提出一种加密方式，同时使用对称加密和非对称加密这种混合加密的方式，既能得到非对称加密的安全性，又能得到对称加密的快速性。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3f586d10-b137-488d-bb20-8d0d41d3521c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先我们上面谈到对称加密时有讲到对称加密的缺点，那就是需要将加密的密钥在互联网上传输，而密钥有可能会被窃听者窃取。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4c8061ec-a76b-4ba8-b66f-a9bd98e0457a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果我们使用非对称加密的方法来加密对称加密的密钥，这样对称加密的密钥就不会被窃听者窃取，因为窃听者没有私钥，然后在下面的通信过程中使用对称加密的密钥加密消息，因为我们只使用了非对称加密加密了对称加密所使用的密钥，而消息的加密都是通过对称加密的密钥加密的，所以不会存在速度慢的问题，这样既保证了安全性，又兼顾了加解密所需的资源和时间。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"44f9c057-de9a-4e0b-98ed-fbc673aacaed","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7a711eac-b766-402d-b85e-b7a1512eff36","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"目前在网页中使用的 HTTPS 协议使用的就是混合加密的方式。"}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"3c01fadf-1d09-45cd-bc53-0cd21291750b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"密钥交换算法"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"76a02ece-78cb-443a-a9f9-2cd00dbb67c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Diffie-Hellman 密钥交换可以解决使用对称加密方法进行通信时密钥被窃听的问题。在讲解该算法的消息过程之前，我们先了解一下该算法的概念。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"66c657db-659b-4948-b1ca-c11206b4b4b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"该算法它可以合成两个密钥"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_af9a9113-4eae-4786-aaa3-a5ddd586a52d.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_af9a9113-4eae-4786-aaa3-a5ddd586a52d.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"1dc3eac4-dd94-4245-840a-6d000871d846","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8f3c5f55-8479-4be1-962d-2f7bb7670b83","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"并且合成的密钥有三个特点"}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"2400e04f-e4f9-4aa3-b674-c94bf4d4424e","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"22120df2-71c1-4016-864c-5ae45cc5bca7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"edd6047a-2a36-4b5a-b9f4-41526f1dde2f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"已知其中一个密钥，无法根据合成的密钥推断出另一个密钥"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2868d321-bd3e-487d-b222-2d2f2265acb5.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2868d321-bd3e-487d-b222-2d2f2265acb5.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"28f18a1f-e9f6-4514-8dc5-74d554dbd75c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b3ee5a73-6b2d-4dab-892d-680b0cab54c4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c066be14-ff0f-4e21-87bd-c7dcdba79879","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"合成的密钥可以继续与其他的密钥进行合成"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"aa569ac9-6439-4d2b-9162-12b65dbdc91b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6ab1c3b3-ba8e-4999-9da6-87b153e28558","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"密钥合成的结果与合成的顺序无关"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8f4533cb-13c2-42eb-96c0-d74e7a033b0a.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8f4533cb-13c2-42eb-96c0-d74e7a033b0a.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"765e3bea-cd27-4f1c-8be4-030075f16f1e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a96a45fe-3a62-4d5b-86e2-66cf28e0e65e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在我们就使用这种方法在 A 和 B 之间传递密钥，首先由 A 生成密钥 P，然后将该密钥发送给 B，在这个过程中有可能被窃听者 X 窃取到密钥，所以这时的密钥不能被用来加密消息"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7ad2ea3d-d1ff-4243-87c7-04a7487fdb8a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"<img src=\"https://gitee.com/lastknightcoder/blogimage/raw/master/20201031102913.gif\" />"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20201031102913_1b802ca9-6180-44be-b396-7d207613d7da.gif","previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20201031102913_1b802ca9-6180-44be-b396-7d207613d7da.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"19b741d9-1662-4bd8-a060-1e70d611fe22","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b1969eb9-8ba4-455b-bed1-d3802f012c58","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接着 A 和 B 各自生成自己的私钥 SA 和 SB，并使用上述的合成方法与密钥 P 进行合成，然后发送给对方，双方接收到对方合成的密钥后，再将密钥与自己的私钥合成，如下"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202010311029132022-10-23-19-48-25_3c03f6e6-602c-48a5-9924-b4008a94e06d.gif","previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202010311029132022-10-23-19-48-25_3c03f6e6-602c-48a5-9924-b4008a94e06d.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"927d2df7-5041-4331-8092-e0f5ce347752","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2ca61489-258c-4086-ab18-878676b665ff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最后，A 得到密钥 `P|SB|SA`，而 B 得到密钥 `P|SA|SB`，根据算法特点 $3$，合成的密钥与合成的顺序无关，所以二者的密钥是相同的，所以接下来 A 和 B 可以用该密钥来加密和解密消息。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b908c611-31cd-465a-8b45-f8e6b661c011","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那窃听者有可能窃听该密钥吗? 通过上面的动图我们知道窃听者掌握的信息有密钥 P，以及两个合成密钥 `P|SA` 和 `P|SB`，根据算法特点 $1$，窃听者是无法推断 SA 和 SB 的，所以窃听者就不能合成出密钥 `P|SA|SB`。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"1b88e3e9-e150-4fc2-be7c-9e01d9e4df7c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"消息认证码"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"392d9007-dc3a-470b-9a14-64d012c78292","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"消息认证码可以检测篡改，例如下面的场景"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202011041404052022-10-23-19-49-12_deb08c2f-1dbb-4512-b9cb-c3cb4c05f1df.gif","previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202011041404052022-10-23-19-49-12_deb08c2f-1dbb-4512-b9cb-c3cb4c05f1df.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"4406031e-37e7-4ae0-9a0e-81225235a979","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"04f5b89e-cab7-40ff-b71c-bfd5a41665db","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"A 向 B 发送一个消息，在中途消息被恶意用户修改了，但是 B 并没有意识到消息已经被修改了，以为接收到的消息就是 A 发送的消息。消息认证码可以预防这种情况发生。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4a8b97ca-210d-4131-9d76-fabf6e93fb57","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面看一下使用消息认证码发消息的流程："}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20201104144958942022-10-23-19-49-48_368e8219-c712-41ca-81e0-921e146de683.gif","previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20201104144958942022-10-23-19-49-48_368e8219-c712-41ca-81e0-921e146de683.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"8060a990-54ae-4a05-b5cd-f0dd36a758cc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"19c88aa9-6da8-4ab9-bcc6-a20cfbc4558d","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bb5f2140-1925-4d2f-8144-5cd3c5340eaa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e6f25545-7d6e-482e-bc10-d67cc29ffec9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"A 生成了一个生成消息认证码的密钥，并以安全的方式将密钥发送给了 B"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"21995bb1-0920-410a-91f1-a4ae46e6a0bb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dc0a2d74-e4ba-490b-8b9d-b52995a835bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"A 根据消息内容(已加密)，使用密钥生成一个值，这个生成的值就是消息认证码，简称 MAC(Message Authentication Code)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bf28e1fd-09b1-4890-aec7-4911fa4be158","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5c4ff11d-cd1b-439e-95ec-5b0ccd3638d9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"A 将消息和 MAC 发送给 B"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4efcadf2-af38-4f70-bb76-13115a7745eb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f514f252-b0ab-47bb-a63d-7be83caa9ff8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 根据接收到的消息，使用 A 之前发送的密钥生成一个值，如果这个值与 A 发送过来的 MAC 相同，则可以认为消息是没有被篡改过的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b4784ecb-8d97-4438-aea5-2e3c7bb4e4ff","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c45fb18f-cc41-4cce-9b98-0bda1b2dea1f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接下来只需要对密文解密即可"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ac1f37c3-76c9-48c5-aa6a-cda1a96f73ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果在中途 X 对 A 发送的消息进行了篡改，那么 B 收到的密文和 A 发送的密文不同，那么 B 生成的消息认证码和 A 发送的消息认证码就不相同，这个时候 B 就知道消息被篡改过了，这时可以要求 A 重新发送消息。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"25c40fd2-6a22-4d6f-b777-9e6f9790cf16","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数字签名"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"acc83912-4bcc-4c87-9167-5d24980faacd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"消息认证码虽然解决了篡改的问题，但是因为他们使用的是相同的密钥加密和解密，所以 B 也可以生成消息认证码，所以事后 A 可以否认消息并不是他发的，因为不仅仅是他可以生成消息认证码(事情又不是我一个人可以干，你凭什么说是我干的)。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"43b3d4d0-dab7-477b-b82a-1a941f99f13e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用数字签名不仅可以解决篡改问题，还可以解决事后否认问题。假设 A 给 B 发送消息，我们首先看一下流程："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"fae42561-cfca-4f3f-95e4-726b003abf39","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"319edbf5-870a-4174-96d5-51fe7a299746","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3fafb515-959f-4a90-942d-8cecfad3505b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"A 在发送前给消息加上数字签名，数字签名只能由 A 生成"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"baf814f9-7661-4d10-97c3-09c387d20d3e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"26aef52b-986c-4f35-aff6-aeabad1bf852","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 收到 A 的消息，验证数字签名的正确性，但是无法生成数字签名"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a27d253a-08d6-4d75-960a-b3cf37e72613","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为数字签名只能由 A 生成，所以 A 无法在事后否认(这件事情就你能干，不是你干的是谁干的)。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"66744df9-b051-48c4-87e1-7c4e3a950b31","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们看一下使用数字签名通信的详细过程："}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202011042043302022-10-23-19-50-39_52cd80f3-4561-485e-9871-e1fd20bb76e8.gif","previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202011042043302022-10-23-19-50-39_52cd80f3-4561-485e-9871-e1fd20bb76e8.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"6f092344-b4db-45dc-91b5-4542e85cdd4b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"414c6180-bfb4-45a0-a415-2539e44d73f0","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7b2cf6b8-1a74-4f03-a4c1-adb753a5bae2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e38afc63-3610-4d19-aa9f-9dcae341706b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"A 生成一对公钥和私钥，公钥是每个人都知道的，私钥是 A 独有的，A 使用私钥对消息(已加密后的消息)加密，得到数字签名"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5d6e94a8-46dd-4971-912d-d07b948830e3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2fed8485-02c1-4642-bb8d-86063c9f98b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"A 将消息以及数字签名发送给 B"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"26046248-1416-4dec-ae74-de597972d064","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d354be01-9894-4db4-8f1d-51208b46dd1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 使用 A 的公钥对消息解密，得到一个数字签名，验证该数字签名与 A 发送数字签名是否相同"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"16d98a62-a803-4257-9ffc-1e8ba50760a4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"001c0cb6-8501-48fa-9b56-ce2f0d894d63","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数字签名确认无误，说明消息没有经过篡改，并且可以确认消息是 A 发的，可以对消息解密得到明文"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"bc0b7a11-80ba-4339-8f50-2dd0962cfba7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fecd3609-dd3a-4ba9-8fb8-552b3cfd88fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"密，得到密文防止被窃听，第二次加密是根据密文生成数字签名。对应的也要进行两次解密，第一次解密是为了得到数字签名，从而验证数字签名的正确性，如果数字签名确认无误，那么就需要进行第二次解密，将密文变换为明文，得到真正的消息。"}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"c4c4ef49-990c-4372-9c58-bf7a2c96243e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e1e5738c-5d83-4622-83e0-b19f3ea6133c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"事实上，使用私钥对全部的消息进行加密比较耗费时间，一般是根据消息生成哈希值，然后对哈希值加密得到数字签名。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8b2a79c5-10f7-4bea-85ee-3920c57876ff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为数字签名是使用私钥进行加密的，只有 A 有私钥，所以 A 无法事后否认。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"fe2bbf6c-3207-4a05-b201-78367f3f36eb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"690b4e8d-d445-4b25-bee7-b64aed38f81c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在本小节比较强调数字签名在事后否认方面的作用，但是数字签名可以用来检测消息是否被篡改，因为数字签名的生成与消息的内容是有关的，如果消息被篡改了，那么生成的数字签名就不对，就可以得知消息被篡改了或者不是 A 发送的消息。"}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"4cffda62-21b5-43c1-a469-f2c66a3e2413","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数字证书"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"761820cb-52b1-41cc-85c7-f6abaa8596a6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为数字签名没有解决公开密钥制作者的问题，所以如果 X 假冒 A 给 B 发送消息，此时 X 会生成一对公钥和私钥，并且将公钥发送给 B，因为公钥中没有携带发送者的信息，B 就会使用该公钥来验证数字签名，对于 B 来说他以为自己在和 A 通信，实际上在与 A 通信。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"edf7e389-0e7e-4f97-8166-3927d920412a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解决这个问题需要使用数字证书，假设 A 给 B 发送消息，通信过程如下："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"1004fe63-56ab-4646-b2b9-c92a0e3e9311","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6784fde2-3f6f-44c0-b6b1-79d99b28d623","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a17c243e-1b2c-43a5-bbb6-c9e71b0fae71","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"A 将包含公开密钥以及自己的相关信息(如邮箱)的个人资料发送给认证中心"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202011042203512022-10-23-19-52-38_7222ab5a-227f-4193-ad32-82fc57a29403.gif","previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202011042203512022-10-23-19-52-38_7222ab5a-227f-4193-ad32-82fc57a29403.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"a7f4c094-36e3-45a2-af6c-bde2e0766f90","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"acabb970-a432-4285-a3a3-bce2fda9d7d4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8563521a-933a-4400-92ac-27943620e074","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"认证中心根据 A 的资料使用自己的私钥生成一个数字签名，并且将数字签名以及资料放进同一个文件中"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202011042209202022-10-23-19-53-44_066e7a13-e469-40cc-8d9c-fe526ecd1f84.gif","previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202011042209202022-10-23-19-53-44_066e7a13-e469-40cc-8d9c-fe526ecd1f84.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"95ffa7f0-eff3-45cd-932b-a102f749909c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bbe0149a-7b9e-41ec-9600-967977cc679d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2dda7190-fe50-40c8-a785-f1c788d70f05","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"认证中心将该文件发送给 A，该文件就是 A 数字证书"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202011042211062022-10-23-19-54-38_596f9f40-d985-4274-b9e8-baa339d72f4f.gif","previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/202011042211062022-10-23-19-54-38_596f9f40-d985-4274-b9e8-baa339d72f4f.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"b5a36226-f02b-4419-a3f2-3e72de820ded","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7f33d9a7-1e7c-4b00-ae7d-a754053aa23e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0ecd7563-cb63-4187-a725-d8d5f5bd9523","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"A 将包含公开密钥的数字证书发送给 B，B 收到证书后，首先对 A 的身份进行确认(如邮箱是否是 A 的邮箱)，接着获取认证中心的公开密钥，使用认证中心的公开密钥对数字签名进行确认，判断是否是认证中心给出的签名"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"fe057e2a-4472-4be7-a29f-df7d0aa16737","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7f9cce91-4f8b-47e5-bba3-7a83f232b019","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果确认 A 的信息无误，以及签名是认证中心的签名，那么就从证书中取出 A 的公开密钥"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ac60fa47-3c89-428c-9299-d7904333fb78","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果这时 X 假冒 A 给 B 发送它的公开密钥，这时 B 没有必要信任以非证书的形式发送的公开密钥；这时 X 为了假冒 A 在认证中心登记自己的公开密钥，但是 X 无法使用 A 的信息(如邮箱)，因此无法获得 A 的证书。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4340116a-5951-4e37-901c-82db1b5e56d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"通过数字证书，消息的接收者可以确认公开密钥的制作者。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"4d7976b9-262d-47f9-969b-e79dc33bd825","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"74d66915-c169-49e1-b200-8d9249577d53","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是目前还有一个疑问，B 从认证中心得到的公开密钥真的来自于认证中心吗? 如果认证中心也是假冒的呢?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c29dfcde-ba35-4aab-b29f-8f91cef5f439","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实际上，认证中心的公开密钥也是以数字证书的形式交付的，会有更高级别的认证中心对这个认证中心署名。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5d2d1319-e67c-4100-8e68-da616c3eb191","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设存在一个被社会广泛认可的认证中心 A，此时出现了一家新公司 B 想开展认证中心业务，但是 B 没有得到社会的认可，于是 B 向 A 申请发行数字证书，A 会对 B 是否能开展认证业务进行检测，如果通过了检测，A 就会向 B 发行证书，公司 B 就可以向社会表示自己获得了公司 A 的信任。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ffe83f85-e0d6-4ba8-a186-4b484fcc4a7c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最顶端的认证中心被称为根认证中心，其自身的正当性由自己证明。如果根认证中心不被信任，整个过程就无法运转，所以根认证中心一般是大型企业或者与政府有关联且已经获得了社会信赖的组织。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4c51742d-4c4d-4cfe-baff-0b809c6c570d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"452e23b4-d40a-495a-9dc7-a0b17a6c76ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考资料"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"96cbdbf4-e1a6-4974-a897-93c7d8a31f20","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"eefc2448-31d6-46fb-8a63-a5c2780d862b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"243e6e69-419b-4fa4-9fbb-238737cbd81a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《我的第一本算法书》"}]}]}]}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/karsten-winegeart-78bm6j3Vc5A-unsplash_28a54ae0-bb41-4c89-a6cc-90b0b72469f3.jpg","createTime":1601726952000,"updateTime":1753370339551},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1753370339551},"pluginRenderers":[{"runtimeVersion":1,"manifest":{"id":"tau.html","name":"HTML","version":"0.1.11","categories":["editor","ai"],"keywords":["HTML","网页","嵌入"],"apiVersion":1,"format":"cjs","main":"main.js","styles":"main.css","skills":["authoring"],"integrity":{"main.js":"968d6dd4153a56e6a91e0990d98b68c75255776b56b323facc1bfd5037fe0602","main.css":"468f2feb73a33e5711b1583b609e4ab3818e83d5f19a38dcd9d027b77eb269d8","skills/authoring/SKILL.md":"5a476fc110584964ab053cb40f0399ec27125bc1d315b6d50b019fbd9b112aa0"},"formatVersion":3,"platform":"portable","profile":"web-v1","description":"在文档中编辑行内与块级 HTML，支持 Tailwind 样式、博客发布和静态导出。","targets":{"desktop":{"minAppVersion":"0.59.5"},"android":{"minAppVersion":"0.2.7"},"ios":{"minAppVersion":"0.2.7"}}},"entry":"../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.11/fc2c10e9d04101645a92fb3123d7d6c355005213fcb06e9f3dab58168bbab594/main.js","styles":"../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.11/fc2c10e9d04101645a92fb3123d7d6c355005213fcb06e9f3dab58168bbab594/style.css","nodeTypes":["html-block","html-inline"]}],"contentStyles":[{"href":"../styles/07ef9b0bc5f675cae16809d6b062102bc14fa8077abff515eae95472f477def7.css","integrity":"07ef9b0bc5f675cae16809d6b062102bc14fa8077abff515eae95472f477def7"}]}